              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwakela nakwanakeni dehi yuma yejima yiwunakoŋi, wakaanukaŋa, wakakwata chikasa kuleanwa nansonyi yiwakatiya, hiwakajikula nawa cheŋi mukanwa keyuku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova.",
